
>> countries := सूची नवीन
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := सूची नवीन
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods नुसार: countries, प्रत्येक: { :key :value
	counter बेरीज: 1.
}.

आउटपुट लिहा: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), नवी-ओळ.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] अक्षरे क्रम-लावा: { :v
	counter बेरीज: 0.
}.

आउटपुट लिहा: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), नवी-ओळ.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter बेरीज: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


आउटपुट लिहा: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), नवी-ओळ.

